{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10135160","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10135160","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1013516001:2":{"text":"まったく、ここに配属されるって知ってたら、荷物運びの方に行ってたのに！","source_cn":"哼，早知道被派来这里，我还不如去运送货物呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F30C7B74B783C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013516002:1":{"text":"少しいいだろうか？荷物運びとはどんな荷物を運ぶのだ？","source_cn":"这位女士，请问你运送的是什么货物？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2C8DFD69CDC0818","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013516003:1":{"text":"ほら、今あたしが組み立ててる物よ。っていうか――","source_cn":"呐，就我在组装的这些玩意儿。要我说——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2E598A5846B31B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013516004:1":{"text":"完成した奴もそんなに強くないじゃない。まだあたしらのボスの方が強いわ！","source_cn":"组装完的东西，也没那么能打嘛。还不如我们老大！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA3361FCF00D3F51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1013516005:2":{"text":"ボスというのは、ブラックゴールド商会の人ですか？","source_cn":"你们的老大是黑金商会的人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A15BB50D04B26B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013516006:1":{"text":"んなわけないでしょ、ボスはブラッドムーンの申し子、長夜の先駆者、金鉱の独裁者、銀毛の主、月下の狂狼よ！","source_cn":"怎么可能，他可是血月降生，长夜第一人，掘金独裁者，银毛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4CC689EABAE755A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1013516006":{"text":"んなわけないでしょ、ボスはブラッドムーンの申し子、長夜の先駆者、金鉱の独裁者、銀毛の主、月下の狂狼よ！","source_cn":"怎么可能，他可是血月降生，长夜第一人，掘金独裁者，银毛之主，月下狂狼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4CC689EABAE755A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013516007:1":{"text":"一人に決まってるでしょ！偉大なるババリアの狂狼を知らないの？とんだ田舎者ね！","source_cn":"一个人啊，伟大的蛮血狂狼！你们都不知道吗？孤陋寡闻！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5751F06F72FF971","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1013516008:1":{"text":"あっち行って。これ以上田舎者とは話したくないわ。","source_cn":"走开吧，我不要跟你们这些土包子讲话了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x244D65519A3C5C89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"いったい何人いるんだ？","source_cn":"所以，这是几个人？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x48F5EE7C9750D0E5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"いったい何人いるんだ？","female":"いったい何人いるの？","variant_male_record_index":"62536","variant_female_record_index":"62537","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","d